      "_localized": {
        "/Name": {
          "key": "SoldierPartnerGroup.1.1",
          "zh_TW": "空白旅團",
          "zh_CN": "空白旅团",
          "sources": {
            "zh_TW": "language/zh_TW/SoldierPartnerGroup.json",
            "zh_CN": "language/zh_CN/SoldierPartnerGroup.json"
          }
        },
        "/Desc": {
          "key": "SoldierPartnerGroup.1.2",
          "zh_TW": "空白旅團棋子施放技能，全體空白旅團獲得「雛菊」。\n「雛菊」：攻擊<color=#f98037><sprite name=\"Soldier_00_PartnerAttr_Atk\" tint></color>提升5%，暴擊傷害<color=#f98037><sprite name=\"Soldier_00_PartnerAttr_CritPower\" tint></color>提升10%。\n全場「雛菊」總層數達到30層時開啟「三連新星」。\n「三連新星」：所有棋子回能效率<color=#f98037><sprite name=\"Soldier_00_PartnerAttr_RecoveryEnergy\" tint></color>提升20%，暴擊率<color=#f98037><sprite name=\"Soldier_00_PartnerAttr_CritRate\" tint></color>提升100%，持續5秒,結束後清除場上所有「雛菊」。",
          "zh_CN": "空白旅团棋子施放技能，全体空白旅团获得「雏菊」。\n「雏菊」：提升5%攻击<color=#f98037><sprite name=\"Soldier_00_PartnerAttr_Atk\" tint></color>，提升10%暴击伤害<color=#f98037><sprite name=\"Soldier_00_PartnerAttr_CritPower\" tint></color>\n全场「雏菊」总层数达到30层时开启「三连新星」。\n「三连新星」：所有棋子提升20%回能效率<color=#f98037><sprite name=\"Soldier_00_PartnerAttr_RecoveryEnergy\" tint></color>，提升100%暴击率<color=#f98037><sprite name=\"Soldier_00_PartnerAttr_CritRate\" tint></color>，持续5秒，结束后清除场上所有「雏菊」",
          "sources": {
            "zh_TW": "language/zh_TW/SoldierPartnerGroup.json",
            "zh_CN": "language/zh_CN/SoldierPartnerGroup.json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
